# DigitalGuardian area 53 (world 1baa96c2, 09_cliff_temple_dark), dg24: the head codes
# SetPlatformPosition (fn_14_153D0), Stage3Start (fn_14_149F8), EnableDynamicCollision
# (fn_14_14828) and DisableDynamicCollision (fn_14_14664), all by codecall.
# Run: BUILD=$PWD/build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_states.py <out>
#   1baa96c2,09_cliff_temple_dark --con tools/cov/specs/digitalguardian_dg24.con --fast --frames 400
# The null-collider arms: the head's three colliders (u0572..u0574 in these runs, listed by objs)
# are deleted at the end; the no-waypoint arm deletes the IS06/FOLW waypoint 0x00350272.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11; god 1
@f150 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f152 place e0035000f player 20; fsm e0035000f FaceTarget
# no retreat platform yet (0x1038 invalid)
@f160 codecall e0035000f SetPlatformPosition; codecall e0035000f EnableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f DisableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f Stage3Start
@f170 codecall e0035000f SelectRetreatPlatform; codecall e0035000f SetPlatformPosition; codecall e0035000f DisableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f EnableDynamicCollision
@f180 objs CCollisionActor; obj e0035000f
# the balls at HP 1 (fn_14_13318): Enable re-activates them
@f200 codecall e0035000f DisableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f EnableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f Stage3Start
@f220 send e00350272 Delete
@f222 codecall e0035000f Stage3Start
@f240 objs CCollisionActor
@f250 send u0574 Delete; send u0573 Delete; send u0572 Delete
@f252 codecall e0035000f EnableDynamicCollision; codecall e0035000f DisableDynamicCollision
@f260 status
